 <76> 对国家安全功勋人员的奖励等支付规定部分修改如下。\n\n  第三条第一款中的“海上警察局局长”应改为“海上保安局局长”。\n\n  第 4 条第 2 款中的“安全与公共管理部”应改为“政府行政与内政部”。\n\n  <77> 至 <418> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00081","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002656-281467-ko","scope":"BODY","start":9569,"end":9594,"target_id":"6865bfa6afed09de0e5362fdaf40a3cd6298ecdfa353fe8e48a69d6d681b0eb2","source_hash":"afacfc33fe98656ce1d22be2d84e02f0584f10d43463b49b02d18795b9043a4e","text":"补充规定 <第27707号，2016年12月30日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00082","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002656-281467-ko","scope":"BODY","start":9594,"end":9623,"target_id":"e90d6638b68380b7d4c27718a05f4da1c09e5da091fdbe70db01755e544ad222","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00083","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002656-281467-ko","scope":"BODY","start":9623,"end":9708,"target_id":"cebee7db904a74ba4d5e9725cd54a93ff5f6b6ae817a683ebfa8c4e49161dd8c","source_hash":"87793277ec4a6f94c80a23332848b3ecc9d5ec7894c1b91865d73bcd096e3e7e","text":"第 2 条（适用于调整奖金上限）第 12 条第 1 款第 1 项的修订规定也适用于委员会提出请求但在本法令生效前尚未作出决定的案件。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00084","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002656-281467-ko","scope":"BODY","start":9708,"end":9750,"target_id":"901f950da6d058a4c28d83323f44923d215a4196f67f49240bae48870dc9a980","source_hash":"2229ee61688f381fa8791a317dce02e692966c0fc8dfff0224bc44e3cd9315a8","text":"增编（内政安全部及其附属机构的组织结构）<2017年7月26日，第28211号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00085","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002656-281467-ko","scope":"BODY","start":9750,"end":9875,"target_id":"7c6c06e0bd4d118a59e0391f2521ebf172410af57637245c1c8bbf986904737f","source_hash":"e322c6bccc7dc02efb62fdad6a23702463436edc72b2f2f5029c536f3946505e","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。但是，根据补充法令第八条修正的总统令中，修正在本法令生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的总统令的部分，应自相关总统令各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00086","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002656-281467-ko","scope":"BODY","start":9875,"end":9892,"target_id":"2dee51d28d8cc6b0e2c16effed1fd2fe45bfc9a193ead8e66945fa0e7d3a150e","source_hash":"d9985315e81c5ba7d5516a248b6bd3f949098433ce3c6da