老金法」”应改为“「公务员意外事故补偿法」”。\n\n  省略 ⑫ 至 <43>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00093","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002656-281467-ko","scope":"BODY","start":10287,"end":10296,"target_id":"2aa9639bfd01abaedec1c0c4d9438bed6c7d764abd29d93d87d490a60ffde31c","source_hash":"65c11253f49a539e75a31d7bb95088b1558a57580a73ed6c70911251e7bef53e","text":"第19条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00094","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002656-281467-ko","scope":"BODY","start":10296,"end":10339,"target_id":"e3bf18581f109bc798df183643f06d8151bb3713ad03f116d112a478fbcb963e","source_hash":"baec3f99ade30a202d6a89709bb55ad57d1ae05856b2f45453a1b42aec39e32f","text":"补充规定 <第30321号，2020年1月7日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00095","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002656-281467-ko","scope":"BODY","start":10339,"end":10376,"target_id":"1ba6e4a3c87f8420ac349b5fb034ee31da8d66ea56914971f1561a86f690e670","source_hash":"671846f21e7ac8f3326320c074739860041c8aee4ca3ba94f1bcc7bb94f8c49d","text":"补充规定（《军事人员事故赔偿法》实施细则）<第30760号，2020年6月9日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00096","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002656-281467-ko","scope":"BODY","start":10376,"end":10412,"target_id":"39df3d04985afd5d4a766a4928a72afef13bd961149323212f241ead30ff552d","source_hash":"57bbe42ff09997b339dc9b4fc0eb76a633b4f0a6e735b2e5d29116175937c588","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2020年6月11日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00097","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002656-281467-ko","scope":"BODY","start":10412,"end":10430,"target_id":"22fa4138e4051e74451636fd0cde4230dfc9183d8e452ce17cfc53224a70a2d7","source_hash":"ce3a74f7ecf254433f677a2b0977dfbdc06b40b8f6c872b14e55c365032afe96","text":"省略第 2 至 11 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00098","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002656-281467-ko","scope":"BODY","start":10430,"end":10502,"target_id":"fe71614eb4b1c05939ee239bb1ab9288936b885787f6009e66d5dd11f03244a3","source_hash":"08cf608769aa540dfe2103ac545bcfa683d1da8d2d5fb63dc58fc0f5c9bac61c","text":"第十二条（修改其他法律）①至⑥ 省略\n\n  7. 对国家安全功勋人员的奖励等支付规定作如下部分修改。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00099","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002656-281467-ko","scope":"BODY","start":10502,"end":10559,"targ